# 数据库和配置

智慧党建项目的数据库和配置详情。

## 数据库配置
项目使用MySQL数据库，配置在application.yml中：

```yaml
spring:
  datasource:
    name: party_build_db
    type: com.alibaba.druid.pool.DruidDataSource
    druid:
      filters: stat
      driver-class-name: com.mysql.cj.jdbc.Driver
      url: jdbc:mysql://${MYSQL_HOST:localhost}:${MYSQL_PORT:3306}/${MYSQL_DATABASE:party_build_db}?useUnicode=true&characterEncoding=utf8&useSSL=false&serverTimezone=Asia/Shanghai&allowMultiQueries=true&zeroDateTimeBehavior=convertToNull&allowPublicKeyRetrieval=true
      username: ${MYSQL_USERNAME:root}
      password: ${MYSQL_PASSWORD:password}
```

## 数据库表映射
- [mapping目录](mdc:codes/hs-zhdj-community/src/main/resources/mapping) - 包含MyBatis映射XML文件
- [generatorConfig.xml](mdc:codes/hs-zhdj-community/src/main/resources/generatorConfig.xml) - MyBatis Generator配置

## Redis缓存配置
项目使用Redis作为缓存，配置在application.yml中：

```yaml
spring:
  cache:
    redis:
      time-to-live: 60s
    type: redis
  redis:
    host: ${REDIS_HOST:localhost}
    port: ${REDIS_PORT:6379}
    database: ${REDIS_DATABASE:0}
    password: ${REDIS_PASSWORD:}
    timeout: 10000
```

## 应用程序配置
主要配置文件为[application.yml](mdc:codes/hs-zhdj-community/src/main/resources/application.yml)，包含以下关键配置：

1. 服务器配置：
```yaml
server:
  port: ${SERVER_PORT:8062}
  tomcat:
    max-connections: 100000
```

2. 系统参数配置：
```yaml
appconfig:
  appid: ${APP_ID:changeit}
  secret: ${APP_SECRET:changeit}
  isDev: ${IS_DEV:false}
  canLog: ${CAN_LOG:false}
  uploadfile-url: ${UPLOAD_FILE_URL:/app/data/zhdj/sitefile}
```

3. 微信支付配置：
```yaml
wechat-pay-config:
  appId: ${WECHAT_PAY_APP_ID:'changeit'}
  mchId: ${WECHAT_PAY_MCH_ID:'changeit'}
  mchKey: ${WECHAT_PAY_MCH_KEY:'changeit'}
  keyPath: ${WECHAT_PAY_KEY_PATH:'/app/data/zhdj/certs/apiclient_cert.p12'}
```

4. 定时任务配置：
```yaml
appconfig:
  isBackService: ${IS_BACK_SERVICE:true}
  sync-cron-usercount: ${SYNC_CRON_USERCOUNT:'0/5 * * * 1 ?'}
  sync-cron-userage: ${SYNC_CRON_USERAGE:'0 0 23 1 1 ?'}
```

## 日志配置
日志配置位于[logback-spring.xml](mdc:codes/hs-zhdj-community/src/main/resources/logback-spring.xml)文件中。
